  message: "Fixed in PR #1395 (f22643887e). _classify_symbols now memoizes classify_file per PATH. The is_exported modifier fold and the dependency-kind branch stay per symbol.\nBehavioral evidence: TestClassifySymbolsOncePerPath, a production-path test that calls the real _classify_symbols. Six symbols over two files give exactly two classify_file calls, each symbol carries its file's tier/reason/is_test_file, and is_exported stays per symbol. It was red on the old code (6 calls for 2 paths). smart-test: 7773 passed, changed source at 100% coverage.\nMeasured effect: per-path vs per-symbol classify_file on a 300-path nestjs sample, 8.2x. NOT measured: the end-to-end survey saving on flink/vscode. It will be measured in the combined-tree flink/nextjs survey after WI-kakov, WI-babuk and WI-rukaz land."  # efaa
